DELETE /v2/{teamSlug}/{projectSlug}/{repositoryName}/manifests/{reference}
DELETE /v2/:teamSlug/:projectSlug/:repositoryName/manifests/:reference Reference must be a digest.
Required: teamSlug (path) — Single Docker repository team slug component.; projectSlug (path) — Single Docker repository project slug component.; repositoryName (path) — Single Docker repository name component.; reference (path) — Content-addressable digest (algorithm:hex).

GET /v2/{teamSlug}/{projectSlug}/{repositoryName}/manifests/{reference}
GET /v2/:teamSlug/:projectSlug/:repositoryName/manifests/:reference Fetch a manifest by tag or digest.
Required: teamSlug (path) — Single Docker repository team slug component.; projectSlug (path) — Single Docker repository project slug component.; repositoryName (path) — Single Docker repository name component.; reference (path) — Manifest reference: a tag or digest.

PUT /v2/{teamSlug}/{projectSlug}/{repositoryName}/manifests/{reference}
PUT /v2/:teamSlug/:projectSlug/:repositoryName/manifests/:reference Upload an image manifest. The digest is computed from the body and returned in the Docker-Content-Digest header.
Required: teamSlug (path) — Single Docker repository team slug component.; projectSlug (path) — Single Docker repository project slug component.; repositoryName (path) — Single Docker repository name component.; reference (path) — Manifest reference: a tag or digest.
